  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mustafa vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 11 February, 2020",
    "facts": "The Government issued a notification F.No.P-15025/41/2011- DQFC, dated 4th August, 2011 according to which so far as Chapter 9 is concerned, section 48 to 80 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 were notified and enforced by S.O.1855(E), dated 29 th July, 2010.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the applicant has submitted that applicant was on bail during the trial as well as appeal and he did not misuse the liberty so granted to him. It is further submitted that the offence alleged to have been registered on 22.01.2011 at about 01:00 pm and after completion of the enquiry, complaint was filed on 14.07.2011.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the applicant has submitted that applicant was on bail during the trial as well as appeal and he did not misuse the liberty so granted to him. It is further submitted that the offence alleged to have been registered on 22.01.2011 at about 01:00 pm and after completion of the enquiry, complaint was filed on 14.07.2011.",
